{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>What</b> — this is the meaning of the kindness that you said, that you would return to know HaShem." "<b>Like a morning cloud</b> — that does not endure." "<b>And the word משכים</b> — it is not a verb, as in: משכים היו, as though it is a noun for dawn. And in my opinion: since each of them says משכים היו, this one too will be likewise."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:22.913416667Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}